### API alive, no SQL dependency: HTTP 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/health

### Database AND foundation schema readiness: HTTP 200 or 503
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/health/ready

### Stable JSON 404 (business routes not implemented yet)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/patients

### Same API through Vite proxy: HTTP 200 when both servers run
GET http://127.0.0.1:5173/api/health
